{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "note": "sing-box 逐出站试建语料：只记会失败的输入。category / path / note 手写（依据设计稿与 sing-box 的行为），由 libcore 的 TestTrialCorpus 用真实的 vendored sing-box 逐条核对，不从 JVM 输出回填；kind / json 由 GoldenTrialCorpusRegenerateTest 按 server 从构建实际发出的试建 JSON 回填。JVM 侧按 JSON 结构查表，查不到即通过；GoldenJvmBuildTest 核对每条都被查中过。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ss2022-key",
      "server": "bug001-ss2022-b64.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ss2022-b64.example.com",
        "server_port": 8388,
        "method": "2022-blake3-aes-128-gcm",
        "password": "golden*ss2022*not*base64",
        "type": "shadowsocks",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "SS_KEY_BASE64",
      "note": "Shadowsocks 2022 的密钥要是 base64；'*' 不在 base64 字母表里，sing-shadowsocks 解 PSK 时报 decode key"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ss2022-key",
      "server": "bug001-ss2022-length.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ss2022-length.example.com",
        "server_port": 8388,
        "method": "2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm",
        "password": "Z29sZGVuLXNzMjAyMi0xNg==",
        "type": "shadowsocks",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "SS_KEY_LENGTH",
      "note": "2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm 要 32 字节密钥，夹具 SS2022_KEY 是合法 base64 但只有 16 字节，sing-shadowsocks 报 bad key length"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-certificate",
      "server": "bug001-cert-trojan.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-cert-trojan.example.com",
        "server_port": 443,
        "password": "golden-pass-trojan",
        "tls": {
          "enabled": true,
          "server_name": "bug001-cert-trojan.example.com",
          "insecure": false,
          "certificate": "-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nZ29sZGVuLW5vdC1hLWRlci1jZXJ0aWZpY2F0ZQ==\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----"
        },
        "type": "trojan",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "TLS_CERTIFICATE",
      "note": "certificate 是 PEM 外壳、内容不是 DER，证书池读不出任何证书，sing-box 报 failed to parse certificate"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-certificate",
      "server": "bug001-cert-hy2.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-cert-hy2.example.com",
        "server_port": 8443,
        "up_mbps": 0,
        "down_mbps": 0,
        "password": "golden-pass-hy2",
        "tls": {
          "enabled": true,
          "server_name": "bug001-cert-hy2.example.com",
          "insecure": false,
          "alpn": [
            "h3"
          ],
          "certificate": "-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nZ29sZGVuLW5vdC1hLWRlci1jZXJ0aWZpY2F0ZQ==\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----"
        },
        "hop_interval": "10s",
        "type": "hysteria2",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "TLS_CERTIFICATE",
      "note": "Hysteria 2 的自定义 CA 同样走 tls.certificate，同一处报错"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ech",
      "server": "bug001-ech-vmess.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ech-vmess.example.com",
        "server_port": 443,
        "uuid": "5a0c1e2f-3b4d-4e6f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
        "security": "aes-128-gcm",
        "alter_id": 0,
        "tls": {
          "enabled": true,
          "server_name": "bug001-ech-vmess.example.com",
          "insecure": false,
          "ech": {
            "enabled": true,
            "config": [
              "-----BEGIN ECH CONFIGS-----",
              "goldenechconfig!!notbase64",
              "-----END ECH CONFIGS-----"
            ]
          }
        },
        "packet_encoding": "",
        "type": "vmess",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "TLS_ECH_CONFIG",
      "note": "ECH 配置含 '!' 等非 base64 字符，echAsPem 包成一个块后 pem.Decode 取不出块，sing-box 报 invalid ECH configs pem"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ssh",
      "server": "bug001-ssh-key.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ssh-key.example.com",
        "server_port": 22,
        "user": "golden-user",
        "private_key": "-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\nZ29sZGVuLW5vdC1hbi1zc2gtcHJpdmF0ZS1rZXktYnl0ZXM=\n-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----",
        "private_key_passphrase": "",
        "type": "ssh",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "SSH_PRIVATE_KEY",
      "note": "OPENSSH 外壳里是 ASCII 文本，ssh.ParsePrivateKey 报 invalid openssh private key format，sing-box 包成 parse private key"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ssh",
      "server": "bug001-ssh-passphrase.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ssh-passphrase.example.com",
        "server_port": 22,
        "user": "golden-user",
        "private_key": "-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\nb3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEAAAAACmFlczI1Ni1jdHIAAAAGYmNyeXB0AAAAGAAAABDxoz3gMc\nuebeGqFD6xUhzeAAAAGAAAAAEAAAAzAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAINS1OkAW9cuKOebN\nsFpCyJILRcpumA62gbmkufesHRfjAAAAkNlfweBDuPDJRiPOaWz/YPhKNi7QPvkktxfNdW\nMRYSLuL4MJm4aPZW2FU4Uk2Q3o8S7YCuVukEB5lBK6g7cMUZcQIA7M0MGIQQfAdpcxutKI\nF1owLNJHdm70RjUeWU646pB5sebecTR7zltB47DWhpzEVGv7I9McdZWqAHVdvI+GzV8EWO\nxC+nQIkHMKsW6yiA==\n-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----",
        "private_key_passphrase": "",
        "type": "ssh",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSPHRASE",
      "note": "私钥是用口令加密的，节点没填口令，ssh 报 this private key is passphrase protected；规则里口令类排在一般私钥错误之前"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-ssh",
      "server": "bug001-ssh-hostkey.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-ssh-hostkey.example.com",
        "server_port": 22,
        "user": "golden-user",
        "password": "golden-pass-ssh",
        "host_key": [
          "ssh-ed25519 Z29sZGVuLW5vdC1hbi1zc2gtaG9zdC1rZXktYnl0ZXM="
        ],
        "type": "ssh",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "SSH_HOST_KEY",
      "note": "host_key 以 ssh-ed25519 开头但 base64 内容不是公钥结构，ssh.ParseAuthorizedKey 失败，sing-box 报 parse host key；用密码认证，私钥一侧无错"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-wireguard",
      "server": "bug001-wg-private.example.com",
      "kind": "endpoint",
      "json": {
        "address": [
          "10.66.0.2/32",
          "fd00:66::2/128"
        ],
        "private_key": "Z29sZGVuLXdpcmVndWFyZC1wcml2YXRlLWtleS0wMQ==",
        "peers": [
          {
            "address": "bug001-wg-private.example.com",
            "port": 21820,
            "public_key": "Z29sZGVuLXdpcmVndWFyZC1wZWVyLXB1YmtleS0wMDE=",
            "pre_shared_key": "",
            "allowed_ips": [
              "0.0.0.0/0",
              "::/0"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "mtu": 1408,
        "type": "wireguard",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "WG_PRIVATE_KEY",
      "note": "私钥 base64 合法但只有 31 字节：sing-box 构造时不查长度，试建补查（等价于 wireguard-go 启动时的 loadExactHex）"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-wireguard",
      "server": "bug001-wg-peer.example.com",
      "kind": "endpoint",
      "json": {
        "address": [
          "10.66.0.2/32",
          "fd00:66::2/128"
        ],
        "private_key": "Z29sZGVuLXdpcmVndWFyZC1wcml2YXRlLWtleS0wMDE=",
        "peers": [
          {
            "address": "bug001-wg-peer.example.com",
            "port": 21820,
            "public_key": "golden*wireguard*peer*pubkey*bad",
            "pre_shared_key": "",
            "allowed_ips": [
              "0.0.0.0/0",
              "::/0"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "mtu": 1408,
        "type": "wireguard",
        "tag": "neko-trial"
      },
      "category": "WG_PEER_PUBLIC_KEY",
      "note": "对端公钥含 '*'，不是 base64，补查报公钥错误（私钥合法，先查私钥再查公钥）"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-selector-bad-custom-json",
      "server": "bug001-json-unknown-key.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-json-unknown-key.example.com",
        "server_port": 8388,
        "method": "aes-256-gcm",
        "password": "golden-pass-ss",
        "type": "shadowsocks",
        "tag": "neko-trial",
        "golden_unknown_key": 1
      },
      "category": "DECODE",
      "path": "golden_unknown_key",
      "note": "自定义出站 JSON 的键合并进出站选项，sing-box 严格解码拒绝未知字段，报错开头是字段路径 golden_unknown_key"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "bug001-chain-member-bad",
      "server": "bug001-chain-trojan.example.com",
      "kind": "outbound",
      "json": {
        "server": "bug001-chain-trojan.example.com",
        "server_port": 443,
        "password": "golden-pass-trojan",
        "tls": {
          "enabled": true,
