        },
        "type": "trojan",
        "tag": "neko-trial",
        "detour": "neko-trial-next"
      },
      "category": "TLS_CERTIFICATE",
      "note": "链的出口跳（带 detour）的 Trojan 自定义证书读不出来；detour 的有无不影响证书校验"
    },
